Put news images here, grouped by year: assets/img/news/2026/flight-school.jpg

Then reference one from any file in _news/ :

    ---
    layout: post
    date: 2026-07-01
    inline: true
    related_posts: false
    image: news/2026/flight-school.jpg
    image_alt: Students touring the Bill Noe Flight School
    image_width: 260          # optional, px; defaults to 220
    ---

The image renders on both the homepage announcements and /news/.
Items without an `image:` key are unaffected.
